{"id":"f20807264bf6e09e","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-hh-simple-recursive-cover.md","title":"超超简单集合的可计算子集覆盖性质","display":"lem-hh-simple-recursive-cover — 超超简单集合的可计算子集覆盖性质","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-hh-simple-recursive-cover","aliases":["20-lem-hh-simple-recursive-cover"],"display":"lem-hh-simple-recursive-cover — 超超简单集合的可计算子集覆盖性质","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.ce-lattice","source_kind":"external-primary-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-verified","source_reference":"Lerman–Soare (1980), Proposition 1.3 证明中使用的 Lachlan 刻画；所需方向的内部展开","external_pdf_pages":[5],"external_printed_pages":[138],"depends_on":["[[20-df-hh-simple]]","[[20-df-recursive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-hh-simple-recursive-cover"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-hh-simple-recursive-cover</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-hh-simple-recursive-cover — 超超简单集合的可计算子集覆盖性质"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.ce-lattice"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"external-primary-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-verified"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Lerman–Soare (1980), Proposition 1.3 证明中使用的 Lachlan 刻画；所需方向的内部展开"},{"key":"external_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>5</span></div>"},{"key":"external_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>138</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e1683dc500d8b948\" href=\"?note=e1683dc500d8b948\" title=\"20-df-hh-simple\">20-df-hh-simple</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HHsimple}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{HHsimple}(A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e1683dc500d8b948\" href=\"?note=e1683dc500d8b948\" title=\"20-df-hh-simple\">20-df-hh-simple</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}hh\\text{-}simple\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}cover}\\vdash\n\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E\\ \\exists R\\in\\mathcal R\\\n[R\\subseteq X\\land X\\setminus A=R\\setminus A].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}hh\\text{-}simple\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}cover}\\vdash\n\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E\\ \\exists R\\in\\mathcal R\\\n[R\\subseteq X\\land X\\setminus A=R\\setminus A].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此条只补入简单性层级文件实际使用的存在性结论：每个 c.e. 集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的补集上留下的部分，都可由其某个可计算子集覆盖。无需把未定义的 Boolean 上区间作为接口，也不要求从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的指标统一计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 的指标。</p>\n<p>原论文第 138 页 Proposition 1.3 的证明明确使用这一形式的 Lachlan 刻画。这里保留所需方向；超超简单性、c.e. 性和可计算性均使用本书内部定义。</p>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://msp.org/pjm/1980/87-1/pjm-v87-n1-p12-s.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Lerman–Soare, d-simple sets, small sets, and degree classes (1980), p.138</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-hh-simple","status":"resolved","id":"e1683dc500d8b948","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-hh-simple]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-hh-simple","status":"resolved","id":"e1683dc500d8b948","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hh-simple]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hh-simple]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HHsimple}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}hh\\text{-}simple\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}cover}\\vdash\n\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E\\ \\exists R\\in\\mathcal R\\\n[R\\subseteq X\\land X\\setminus A=R\\setminus A].","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":1726,"backlinks":[{"id":"ab77f0806f900cb2","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hh-simple]]；see [[20-df-hypersimple]]；see [[20-df-simple]]；see [[20-df-d-simple]]；see [[20-thm-d-simple-implies-simple]]；see [[20-lem-hh-simple-recursive-cover]]。"}],"outgoing":["e1683dc500d8b948","d6dc5974baa6f8a5"]}